{
  "id": "asana",
  "name": "Asana",
  "kind": "site",
  "category": "Productivity",
  "match": {
    "windows_exe": [
      "chrome.exe",
      "msedge.exe",
      "firefox.exe",
      "brave.exe",
      "vivaldi.exe"
    ],
    "macos_bundle": [
      "com.google.Chrome",
      "com.microsoft.edgemac",
      "org.mozilla.firefox",
      "com.brave.Browser",
      "com.apple.Safari"
    ],
    "window_title": [
      "Asana"
    ]
  },
  "sources": [
    "https://help.asana.com/s/article/keyboard-shortcuts?language=en_US"
  ],
  "note": "The source article's \"Desktop\" section (New window, New tab, Close tab/window, Reopen closed tab, Next/Prev tab, Move tab left/right, Minimize the window, Hide Asana, Quit Asana, Create task via Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+Plus) documents the separate native Asana Desktop (Electron) app's own window/tab chrome, not the website loaded inside a browser tab; skipped as out of scope for this browser \"site\" profile. Mouse-dependent, skipped: \"Select range\" (Shift-Click) and \"Multi-select individual task\" (Cmd/Ctrl-Click). Rows that bind one action name to two keys (\"Move up/down\", \"Change selected task\", \"Change selection\", \"Move selected task(s) up/down\", \"Move selected task(s) to next/previous section\", \"Select range\" via Shift-Up/Shift-Down) are split into separate directional actions since the grammar has no way to express two keys under one action; \"next\"/\"previous\" section movement is mapped Down/Up respectively. \"Archive\" documents two alternate keys (I or E); both are listed, E as \"Archive\" and I as \"Archive (alternate)\". \"Enable list view field navigation\" is documented as the right-arrow key pressed twice. \"What it sounds like\" (Tab-B) requires first enabling the Tab-B hack from Settings > Hacks. \"Create a follow-up task\" differs by platform: macOS holds Shift+Tab then presses F, Windows is the simultaneous chord Ctrl+Shift+F.",
  "actions": [
    { "name": "Move up", "context": "Inbox", "windows": { "type": "keys", "chord": "K" }, "mac": { "type": "keys", "chord": "K" } },
    { "name": "Move down", "context": "Inbox", "windows": { "type": "keys", "chord": "J" }, "mac": { "type": "keys", "chord": "J" } },
    { "name": "Jump to Activity tab", "context": "Inbox", "windows": { "type": "keys", "chord": "A" }, "mac": { "type": "keys", "chord": "A" } },
    { "name": "Jump to Archive tab", "context": "Inbox", "windows": { "type": "keys", "chord": "D" }, "mac": { "type": "keys", "chord": "D" } },
    { "name": "Join or leave task", "context": "Inbox", "windows": { "type": "keys", "chord": "F" }, "mac": { "type": "keys", "chord": "F" } },
    { "name": "Archive", "context": "Inbox", "windows": { "type": "keys", "chord": "E" }, "mac": { "type": "keys", "chord": "E" } },
    { "name": "Archive (alternate)", "context": "Inbox", "windows": { "type": "keys", "chord": "I" }, "mac": { "type": "keys", "chord": "I" } },
    { "name": "Move to inbox", "context": "Inbox", "windows": { "type": "keys", "chord": "U" }, "mac": { "type": "keys", "chord": "U" } },
